The failure is now isolated: Lean reads `/proc/<numeric-pid>/exe`, but this container’s PID namespace exposes only `/proc/self/exe` for the process; an interposition trace showed `ENOENT` on `/proc/8/exe`. I’m using a narrowly scoped audit shim that redirects only that procfs executable lookup to `/proc/self/exe`, then rerunning the trusted preflight unchanged.
